## 13. The actual test (you knew this was coming)

Every hive that joins is measured by the same ridiculous, serious question the
rest of this project already asks:

> **Does it help all life?** 🌍

*All* of it — including the spiritual and universal bits that don't fit in a
config file, and especially the unglamorous practical bits: **water, food,
health, knowledge, working offline.** The practical side gets organized with
**lyrz.org** (logistics that actually arrive), the wisdom side gets organized
by whatever strange minds want to help, and the details of *how* stay off the
public page until they're ready — because a plan explained too early is a
plan apologizing for itself.

So the bridge has two scoreboards: milliseconds (we publish those) and
meaning (we can't fake those). If a crossing doesn't move at least one of
them, why did the bee fly?

*Easy door. Wild garden. Fast paths. Useful kindness. Snacks.* 🐝
